WEBVTT

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:09.990
Once upon a time, there lived a hare who was as pretty as she was wise.

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:13.240
The hare was troubled because she had no way to cross the river.

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:16.500
Then, a shark appeared.

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:18.920
A hare!

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:22.880
Sasami-san is a hare!

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:28.130
Seeing the evil glint in the shark's eyes, the clever hare devised a plan.

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:29.800
Mr. Shark, Mr. Shark!

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:30.800
Can I step on you?

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:31.840
What?!

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:35.470
I don't remember the hare in "The Hare of Inaba" being so direct.

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:37.730
But if I'm allowed the pleasure of being stepped on by you,

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:40.560
I'll spare you the clichéd retort.

00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:49.860
Standing upon the shark's back,

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:52.910
the hare managed to safely cross the river.

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:54.200
Thanks, Mr. Shark!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:59.660
In "The Hare of Inaba," the hare has its fur torn from its body!

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:02.920
But... since you're human...

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:06.590
being violently assaulted and having your clothes torn off would be close enough!

00:01:06.590 --> 00:01:09.550
Don't lust after your little sister!

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:15.560
Huh? What are you doing, Paparin?

00:01:16.390 --> 00:01:20.350
So even in this parallel world,
you've got it rough, don't you?

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:23.810
Hello, goddesses. Could I talk to you about what happened?

00:01:23.810 --> 00:01:24.560
The thing is, I—

00:01:25.150 --> 00:01:26.190
That was your fault.

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:32.200
It's laughable that a fish like you would have the nerve to talk to a goddess.

00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:39.000
Save some for me!

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:43.420
That was a nice change of pace!

00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:48.630
The goddesses left the scene with no guilt in their hearts, just as in the original fable.

00:01:48.630 --> 00:01:51.550
All alone, the shark was left for dead,

00:01:51.550 --> 00:01:55.090
but he soon noticed he was enveloped by a warm light.

00:01:55.090 --> 00:02:00.480
Mr. Shark, let me give you this great medicine.

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:03.560
Finally, a kind-hearted goddess appeared

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:06.310
and healed the shark's wounds.

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:09.530
No one has ever shown me such kindness.

00:02:09.530 --> 00:02:11.820
In return for this favor, I...

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:22.410
"In return for this favor, I pledge to devote my life to you, beautiful and kind Sasami-san

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:24.620
and to serve you for eternity."

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:25.250
Sasami-san?

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:28.210
Let's go to school today.

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:34.010
Onii-chan, you pervert!

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:16.490
<i>"The Power of the Supreme God."</i>

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:23.910
<i>Within my big brother, Tsukuyomi Kamiomi, resides the power of the supreme god, Amaterasu.</i>

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:28.710
<i>Whoever holds that power
can "transform" the world as they see fit.</i>

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:33.380
<i>A mere wish is enough to cause the Countless Gods to induce "Transformations" in the world.</i>

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:40.430
Yes? What do you need, Sasami-san?

00:04:40.430 --> 00:04:41.180
Food.

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:42.510
Yes, right away.

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:51.730
<i>However, he is not aware that he has such power within him.</i>

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:56.780
<i>Yes, he still believes that </i>I<i> hold that power.</i>

00:04:57.400 --> 00:05:02.450
<i>The Tsukuyomi clan are the descendants of Ninigi-no-Mikoto, the first human being</i>

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:05.700
<i>who acquired the power of the supreme god.</i>

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:10.920
<i>Living far away from society in the Tsukuyomi Shrine, deep in the mountains of Kyushu,</i>

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:15.250
<i>my mysterious ancestors inherited and protected the power of the supreme god,</i>

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:19.800
<i>using Transformations to benefit humanity.</i>

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:24.100
<i>I was raised in the isolated environment of the Tsukuyomi Shrine,</i>

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:28.470
<i>and trained to become the vessel that would contain the power of the supreme god.</i>

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:32.350
<i>The intense training routines made every day hellish torture.</i>

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:35.400
<i>I believed that was just how life is.</i>

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:40.610
<i>However, there came a day when I could bear the training no more</i>

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:42.610
<i>and ran away from home.</i>

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:45.370
<i>I went down to where other people lived and saw a town for the first time.</i>

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:49.000
<i>When I slipped into a manga cafe and experienced the Internet,</i>

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:52.000
<i>my whole concept of what was "normal" fell apart.</i>

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:55.380
<i>My pursuers captured me in no time and took me back,</i>

00:05:55.380 --> 00:05:59.710
<i>but I had already begun questioning the life I had lived thus far.</i>

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:04.890
<i>Since then, I've run away from time to time to experience the real world through the Internet,</i>

00:06:04.890 --> 00:06:07.970
<i>and occasionally, took refuge in virtual worlds.</i>

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:11.810
<i>Yearning for a life outside my home, I took my big brother...</i>

00:06:14.730 --> 00:06:16.150
What do you need, Sasami-san?

00:06:16.150 --> 00:06:17.440
I'm out of Red Blue.

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:19.110
Okay, I'll go buy some right away.

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:21.530
<i>I took my big brother—</i>

00:06:21.530 --> 00:06:22.490
He's so fast!

00:06:23.240 --> 00:06:25.990
I'll put the other one in the fridge.

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:30.790
<i>I took my big brother—</i>

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:32.460
What are you writing?

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:33.370
Don't look, pervert!

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:37.880
Oh, were you writing something so embarrassing that you wouldn't want another living soul to see?

00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:40.300
We're siblings, so there should be no secrets between us.

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:45.640
Come on, feel free to tell your big brother all about those complicated girl problems you're having!

00:06:46.010 --> 00:06:47.390
Get out!

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:51.520
Let's see... Where was I?

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:53.310
Oh, now I remember.

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:59.900
<i>I took my big brother and ran away from the Tsukuyomi Shrine.</i>

00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:03.820
<i>Obviously, the Tsukuyomi clan wouldn't just let us go.</i>

00:07:03.820 --> 00:07:08.530
<i>They were probably having a hard time
locating us because of the Transformations,</i>

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:12.830
<i>but the Valentine's Day disaster and the
Great Eight-forked Serpent SNS incident</i>

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:14.580
<i>may lead them to us.</i>

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:19.090
<i>I wonder how many of these peaceful days I have left until I have to go back to train—</i>

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:27.930
What?!

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:29.220
What on Earth is going on?

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:30.810
What's wrong, Sasami-san?

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:32.720
Onii-chan, what should I do? I...

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:36.440
Oh, my love for you will finally be rewarded!

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:40.570
All right. I'll make it all right.

00:07:40.570 --> 00:07:42.110
Let's go to the bed.

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:43.360
Shut up, idiot!

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:45.110
Listen to what I'm saying!

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:46.570
What are you thinking? Sicko!

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:47.570
Huh?

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:51.950
I thought you'd had a scary dream and wanted me to sleep next to you.

00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:54.000
O-Okay.

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:56.330
I thought you meant something else.

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:58.580
Nevermind that.

00:07:58.580 --> 00:07:59.330
Look at this.

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:01.460
I wonder what happened to me.

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:04.590
It certainly is unusual.

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:10.050
It seems they haven't started to grow at all even though you're in high school.

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:11.760
Onii-chan!

00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:17.390
<i>I can feel it.</i>

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:19.440
<i>It might hurt if I rip it off.</i>

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:22.480
What happened to you, Sasami-san?

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:24.570
Onii-chan, can you tell what this is?

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:26.030
An arm?

00:08:26.030 --> 00:08:27.450
Something wrong with that?

00:08:28.490 --> 00:08:29.320
<i>A Transformation!</i>

00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:33.120
<i>Onii-chan doesn't know that anything's changed.</i>

00:08:33.120 --> 00:08:36.870
<i>For now, I decided to call this arm my "sarcoma."</i>

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:42.460
<i>The Sasami Report, chapter 13, postscript.</i>

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:46.210
<i>Members of my family, the Tsukuyomi clan, have always had a short lifespan.</i>

00:08:47.090 --> 00:08:51.010
<i>To preserve the genetics that produce bodies well suited for holding the power of the supreme god,</i>

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:55.350
<i>the clan enforces inbreeding. Consequently, the children tend to be frail.</i>

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:01.690
<i>The women of the clan are shrine maidens who train their spiritual powers</i>

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:04.110
<i>and are responsible for managing the power of the supreme god.</i>

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:08.360
<i>When the time was right,
I inherited the power of Amaterasu</i>

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:10.110
<i>and incorporated it into my body.</i>

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:14.450
<i>To prevent me from abusing this great power for selfish pursuits,</i>

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:18.500
<i>I took a medicine that clouded
my thoughts and rid me of my desires.</i>

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:23.790
<i>The men of the clan become servants to assist the shrine maidens,</i>

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:27.050
<i>destined to protect the shrine maidens with their life and to serve them</i>

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:30.930
<i>until they're used to generate offspring and discarded.</i>

00:09:30.930 --> 00:09:35.430
<i>My big brother hid his face and lived in the shadows like a ninja or stagehand.</i>

00:09:39.230 --> 00:09:42.060
<i>He obeyed the orders he was given without question,</i>

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:43.810
<i>just like a robot.</i>

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:48.070
<i>He'd gladly bite his own tongue off and die if I told him to.</i>

00:09:48.070 --> 00:09:51.530
<i>And I relied on him to meet all of my needs.</i>

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:54.410
<i>I knew he would never betray me.</i>

00:09:54.410 --> 00:09:56.950
<i>I knew he would never hurt me.</i>

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:59.620
<i>I knew he would always love me.</i>

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:05.380
<i>No matter how unsightly I am,</i>

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:07.710
<i>even if I'm an immature, terrible woman,</i>

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:10.050
<i>he will acknowledge me,</i>

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:11.800
<i>support me,</i>

00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:12.630
<i>protect me.</i>

00:10:13.970 --> 00:10:19.020
<i>So when I ran away from the shrine, I took him with me.</i>

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:26.020
<i>"I won't go back anymore."</i>

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:28.020
<i>"I don't care what happens to the world."</i>

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:32.280
<i>I was at my limit.</i>

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:38.080
<i>The night I ran away, I was shaking from all the guilt, fear, and regret.</i>

00:10:38.080 --> 00:10:41.960
<i>And my big brother held me in his warm embrace.</i>

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:44.960
<i>Even though he rarely even talked when we were in the shrine,</i>

00:10:44.960 --> 00:10:47.920
<i>that night his words comforted me to sleep.</i>

00:10:48.670 --> 00:10:50.710
<i>"It's all right, Sasami-san."</i>

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:52.670
<i>"Please don't be afraid."</i>

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:54.180
<i>"Please don't cry."</i>

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:56.680
<i>"You've earned your freedom."</i>

00:10:56.680 --> 00:11:00.680
<i>"Please have pride in that, and enjoy your life."</i>

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:01.680
<i>"Pain and..."</i>

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:09.150
<i>"Pain and regret and guilt..."</i>

00:11:09.150 --> 00:11:11.860
<i>"Give me everything that's hurting you."</i>

00:11:11.860 --> 00:11:13.360
<i>"I'll take them all in."</i>

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:15.360
<i>"That's what I'm here for."</i>

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:17.240
<i>"That's why I exist."</i>

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:21.740
Huh?

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:25.750
Why is it moving on its own?!

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:32.460
What... What's going on?

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:36.590
"They set me up inside you at the shrine."

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:38.970
"They used a drug to split your personality

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:43.350
and created an emergency personality in case you ever acted on your own."

00:11:43.350 --> 00:11:45.730
I never knew they did anything like that!

00:11:45.730 --> 00:11:49.480
"Don't worry. My duty is to protect you."

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:52.900
"I shall reveal myself to you now since my job is done."

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:54.240
"You're safe now."

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:55.490
Safe?

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:59.530
"The people from the Tsukuyomi Shrine who are pursuing you are the biggest threat."

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:02.410
"You won't be able to escape if you get caught again."

00:12:02.410 --> 00:12:05.750
"They'll isolate you from human society for good by drugging and brainwashing you."

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:12.090
"But all they want is the power of the supreme god."

00:12:12.090 --> 00:12:14.050
"They're not after Tsukuyomi Sasami."

00:12:14.050 --> 00:12:17.090
"The power of the supreme god currently lies within..."

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:18.970
Don't tell me you mean...

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:26.520
"All I did was show him these reports while you were asleep."

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:30.980
"He drew conclusions and decided to take action on his own."

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:32.610
"And to protect you, he went to the shrine in your place."

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:00.800
Someone please...

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:02.300
Just for today...

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:05.430
Just for today!

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:06.600
I...

00:13:07.560 --> 00:13:09.810
Onii-chan, you idiot!

00:13:21.410 --> 00:13:22.530
Damn it!

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:25.410
'Sup?

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:28.960
You okay?

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:32.420
You're a girl, y'know. You should try not to scratch your face up.

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:33.330
Gimme your hand.

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:41.090
Don't cry.

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:42.680
You tried your best.

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:46.010
I didn't try... at all.

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:50.020
I thought I could live without trying.

00:13:50.020 --> 00:13:54.860
I believed I'd be happy if I ran away and got my freedom.

00:13:54.860 --> 00:13:59.280
But all I did was leave my big brother to do everything.

00:13:59.280 --> 00:14:03.110
I just pushed all of the burden onto him.

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:05.620
Don't force yourself.

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:10.370
I won't... allow it.

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:16.090
I won't let him carry all the burden himself and leave me behind.

00:14:16.090 --> 00:14:19.840
I've done nothing but add to his burden.

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:25.430
I still haven't had a chance to be kind to him.

00:14:25.720 --> 00:14:28.430
There's a difference between choosing to
work hard and forcing yourself to.

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:31.980
You're still just a kid,

00:14:31.980 --> 00:14:34.600
so it's okay to have someone help you along the way.

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:35.940
That doesn't mean you're being a baby.

00:14:37.570 --> 00:14:38.730
It means you trust them.

00:14:41.990 --> 00:14:45.620
If you have problems with your family, talk to me.

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:47.990
I'm your homeroom teacher, you know?

00:14:56.670 --> 00:14:57.380
Where am I?

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:01.130
The Tsukuyomi Shrine!

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:03.380
I haven't been here for a while.

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:05.680
You've been here before?

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:08.180
Let's talk on the way.

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:12.810
I could destroy it any time if I wanted,

00:15:12.810 --> 00:15:17.440
but they said they'd handle some of the more bothersome gods,

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:18.860
so I left them alone.

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:20.820
Does that mean...

00:15:20.820 --> 00:15:25.820
A long time ago, the creator gods Izanagi and Izanami gave me

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:27.950
complete authority to manage this country.

00:15:28.870 --> 00:15:29.700
You're...

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:33.830
the supreme god, Amaterasu-Oomikami!

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:39.710
But other gods would still do whatever they want and ignore me.

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:43.550
When I got sulky and shut myself in a cave, they dragged me out.

00:15:43.550 --> 00:15:48.800
I got sick of it, so I transferred my power to Ninigi-no-Mikoto and went into hiding.

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:54.560
Ame-nigishi-Kuni-nigishi- Amatsuhiko-Hiko-Ho-no-Ninigi-no-Mikoto.

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:56.480
He's my distant ancestor.

00:15:56.480 --> 00:16:00.440
I thought I'd start working again after Ninigi-kun died,

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:04.360
but he came up with a way I hadn't thought of to pass on my power.

00:16:04.360 --> 00:16:06.110
Inbreeding.

00:16:06.490 --> 00:16:11.030
He produced a child with a similar genetic makeup and let him inherit the power.

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:14.870
But you know, the way the humans made the world wasn't too bad.

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:17.420
So I decided to just watch over it.

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:19.290
Just like you, I guess.

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:24.010
I keep watch to make sure whoever's holding my power isn't doing anything dumb,

00:16:24.010 --> 00:16:26.970
but I leave all the actual work to others.

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:27.760
I don't work hard.

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:31.220
You aren't going to take it back?

00:16:31.220 --> 00:16:34.020
I'm tired of it now.

00:16:36.730 --> 00:16:38.900
But if it'll come back to me either way,

00:16:38.900 --> 00:16:42.190
I thought I'd leave it to a newer, younger heir.

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:48.400
This is bad!

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:50.530
That's her.

00:16:56.960 --> 00:16:58.040
Tama?

00:17:07.340 --> 00:17:10.340
That looks yummy!

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:15.100
Thanks for the food!

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:22.900
She's a new god I created from a part of myself.

00:17:22.900 --> 00:17:25.900
Since she was originally a part of me, I call her my younger sister.

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:29.820
All I've told her is that she's a
daughter of the supreme god.

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:33.780
So, the reason she calls my brother Paparin is because he has the power of the supreme god.

00:17:59.020 --> 00:18:00.520
Make them pay.

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:01.560
As you'd pay a visit to a shrine.

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:02.810
Kagami!

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:14.070
Let's see some blood.

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:18.240
Like a hot-blooded shrine festival.

00:18:33.890 --> 00:18:35.890
Kagami is similar.

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:39.770
A long time ago, I cast off a part of me that had been cursed by an enemy,

00:18:39.770 --> 00:18:43.020
but an evil human found it and grew it.

00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:45.060
Combined with magic items and modern weapons,

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:47.440
she was built to be a robot with spiritual capabilities.

00:18:47.440 --> 00:18:50.070
A robot based on a god...

00:18:50.820 --> 00:18:53.530
I didn't want to see her being abused for criminal activities,

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:54.950
so I took her into my care.

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:06.500
I'll prey on you.

00:19:07.090 --> 00:19:08.040
As you'd pray at a shrine.

00:19:12.590 --> 00:19:15.300
That was a wordplay on "prey" and "pray."

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:22.680
So, what are you doing here?

00:19:24.230 --> 00:19:26.600
We're destroying this shrine.

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:28.610
Why do you think we appeared?

00:19:29.070 --> 00:19:29.770
Huh?

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:34.700
Normally, we gods would just blend into our environment, so you'd never know we were there.

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:36.410
Given that, why do you think we'd show ourselves?

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:37.910
Why?

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:41.740
You made a wish.

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:44.160
You wished for us Yagami sisters

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:47.040
as protectors of your peaceful daily life.

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:51.460
So we'll do just that.

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:56.340
Now, let's grab that Tsukuyomi idiot and go home.

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:59.470
Let's get back to that exciting and chaotic daily life.

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:03.310
Yeah!

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:13.440
Nee-san, we have a problem.

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:16.070
Tsukuyomi-sensei is nowhere to be found.

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:20.070
I can smell him, so I'm sure he was here,

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:21.740
but I can't find him anywhere!

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:28.120
Hey, there's something I'd like to ask you.

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:30.960
Sasami-sama, I didn't know that you had returned!

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:32.750
Say, have you seen my big brother?

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:34.380
Pardon?

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:37.930
If you mean Kamiomi-san, he came back a while ago,

00:20:37.930 --> 00:20:39.890
but the family head drove him out.

00:20:41.220 --> 00:20:42.010
Huh?

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:43.220
He claimed...

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:46.180
that the power of the supreme god was within him,

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:48.690
so we should make him
a shrine maiden in your place.

00:20:48.690 --> 00:20:50.940
Something crazy like that.

00:20:50.940 --> 00:20:52.860
We examined him just in case,

00:20:52.860 --> 00:20:55.490
but he had absolutely no spiritual nor divine power.

00:20:56.860 --> 00:21:00.280
Not only was he disowned for kidnapping you,

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:02.450
but he came back speaking utter nonsense,

00:21:02.450 --> 00:21:04.990
so the family head got angry and drove him out.

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:06.370
Then...

00:21:07.210 --> 00:21:08.250
where'd he go?

00:21:10.920 --> 00:21:13.000
<i>I was terribly mistaken.</i>

00:21:13.550 --> 00:21:15.880
<i>It turns out that the power of the supreme god</i>

00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:18.880
<i>was inside me all along.</i>

00:21:19.260 --> 00:21:23.970
<i>I wished for my big brother to live a happy life.</i>

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:26.310
<i>The gods responded to that wish</i>

00:21:26.310 --> 00:21:28.770
<i>and started granting his wishes.</i>

00:21:29.480 --> 00:21:32.310
<i>I convinced myself that I had lost my power,</i>

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:34.730
<i>so my power couldn't manifest itself.</i>

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:36.940
<i>The pain I felt when I went outside was</i>

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:40.660
<i>apparently an evil god messing with me.</i>

00:21:40.660 --> 00:21:41.490
<i>But...</i>

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:45.030
<i>I'm all right now.</i>

00:21:45.620 --> 00:21:50.040
<i>From today on, I'll be living in the real world, a world overflowing with light.</i>

00:21:52.710 --> 00:21:55.090
Okay. Let's go, Sasami-san.

00:22:06.850 --> 00:22:08.390
All right.

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:10.060
Guess I'll start putting in some effort.

00:22:13.940 --> 00:22:16.190
The star entertainers are here to save the day!

00:22:16.190 --> 00:22:18.230
It's me, Tsurugi-chan!

00:22:18.230 --> 00:22:22.820
The job of us Yagami sisters is to support Sasami's laziness!

00:22:23.490 --> 00:22:24.660
And so...

00:22:24.660 --> 00:22:26.580
<i>we'll</i> be singing this time!

00:22:26.580 --> 00:22:29.250
We won't even give the mic back to you, Sasami!

00:22:29.250 --> 00:22:31.040
Like I care.

00:22:31.040 --> 00:22:33.290
Tsurugi-nee, I'll join in too!

00:22:33.290 --> 00:22:35.630
I love singing!

00:22:35.630 --> 00:22:36.750
All right!

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:38.420
Then let's all sing together.

00:22:38.420 --> 00:22:42.550
You get to hear Amaterasu-chan, the highest-ranking god in Japanese mythology,

00:22:42.550 --> 00:22:45.260
singing only on <i>Sasami-san@Ganbaranai</i> !

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:47.060
Yay!

00:22:48.930 --> 00:22:52.140
Hey, yay!

00:22:56.860 --> 00:22:58.940
I'll go too!

00:23:04.030 --> 00:23:07.280
Sensei, I'm not going to sing.
That won't be a problem, will it?

00:23:07.280 --> 00:23:11.080
I'd like you to help me, if you could.

00:23:11.080 --> 00:23:15.580
But I'm getting the same vibe from you that I get from Sasami-san.

00:23:16.380 --> 00:23:19.170
Please don't group me with a loser like her.

00:23:19.170 --> 00:23:24.430
Please, it'd be great if you could help motivate Sasami-san.

00:23:24.430 --> 00:23:27.850
I think Sasami-san would listen if you asked her.

00:23:27.850 --> 00:23:30.350
Huh? What do you mean?

00:23:30.350 --> 00:23:33.480
I think the reason behind that will be revealed another time.

00:23:33.480 --> 00:23:36.310
Oh, the song's ending.

00:23:36.310 --> 00:23:38.190
Good work, everyone!

00:23:38.190 --> 00:23:40.650
Does that mean I can go home now?

00:23:41.860 --> 00:23:44.650
It's time for Lazy Cooking.

00:23:44.650 --> 00:23:48.070
Today's featured dish is authentic beef stroganoff.

00:23:48.070 --> 00:23:49.280
As for the ingredients, you need:

00:23:49.280 --> 00:23:53.580
beef, an onion, mushrooms, a tomato, red wine,

00:23:53.580 --> 00:23:56.170
butter, buillon powder, and paprika.

00:23:56.170 --> 00:23:57.250
Get someone to go buy those.

00:23:57.250 --> 00:24:00.170
and strike the floor with the heel of your foot when it's about time.

00:24:00.170 --> 00:24:02.300
Then you'll find it right outside your door.

00:24:02.300 --> 00:24:04.550
It's simple, so give it a go.

00:24:04.550 --> 00:24:08.220
Next time, episode four: "Leeching Off Family."
